From 7ad37d4a140a7834c5398efa853b411b8dbc5dd1 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jakub Skokan <jakub.skokan@havefun.cz>
Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 21:12:53 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] portal: compact browser notification menu controls

The workspace menu repeats detailed notification guidance and consumes
space intended for quick controls. Replace it with Notifications and Sound
checkboxes plus a Notification settings link, keeping Test and recovery
in the full panel.

Both surfaces call the same guarded Enable/Disable actions. The menu
shows only confirmed setup, restores pending native toggles, and keeps
uncertain cleanup mixed with one domain-owned error. Sound remains
independent of delivery.

Keep existing worker, storage and server contracts and preserve title
markers and session mutes. Select the updated client and styles in all
notification-control templates.
